    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 11 Castletown Manor, a stunning A-rated four bedroom semi-detached house to the market. This spacious house was completed in 2023 and provides a unique opportunity to acquire an A-rated home in excellent walk-in condition. Castletown Manor is a recently built estate where residents can enjoy the convenience of being located close to Athboy  town centre.\r\n\r\nThe property has been maintained and decorated to a high standard by the current owner and the accommodation features an entrance hall, a bright living room, open plan kitchen/dining area, laundry room and a guest WC on the ground floor. The first floor consists of three spacious double bedrooms including a master ensuite, a single bedroom, storage closet and main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe exterior of the house is a standout feature  with a cobble lock driveway to the front and a spacious low maintenance back garden. This home has a high level of energy efficiency with a BER rating of A2 achieved by using a combination of high-performance building materials and efficient heating equipment. \r\n\r\nResidents of Castletown Manor benefit from its convenient location within walking distance to a host of amenities including O ’Growney National School, Athboy Community School, shops, Pharmacy, and public transport links."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A-Rated home in walk in condition\r\nSituated close to a green area\r\nSpacious open plan kitchen / dining room\r\nLocated within walking distance of all local amenities\r\nProperty was constructed in 2023"
      },
